  "description": "Aspose.Medical for .NET is a comprehensive API for processing DICOM medical images. This cross-platform library enables .NET developers to create, edit, read, convert, and anonymize medical images without requiring third-party applications or dependencies. Version 26.11 introduces DICOM frame export to common image formats, allowing developers to convert individual frames to JPEG, PNG, BMP, and JPEG XL.",
